WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,720
Uncle, you see you really love to joke

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:06,800
Both of our ex-wives put in a lot of effort into that project.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,240
There is no benefit in canceling the correspondent now.

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,200
It doesn't matter

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,040
Our family can afford to lose this little money.

6
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:16,180
I just don’t know if Miss Su can afford the loss.

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:20,830
Today I will meet my uncle and aunt

8
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:22,990
Don't take it to heart

9
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,030
Sister, why do you want to slap yourself in the face?

10
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,470
Do you like to be slapped in the face?

11
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:29,710
Sorry, my smile is low

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:32,510
Oh, girl, your luck won’t be too bad.

13
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,790
Let me give the dog a necklace for generations.

14
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,510
Wow, it fits very well

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:38,190
Pretty little gray

16
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,590
swipe my card

17
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:42,350
Miss Su’s jewelry is from the haute couture series.

18
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,370
Don't you like it very much?

19
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,130
Necklace worth millions

20
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,730
They just bought it for a dog

21
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:51,850
Aunt, how can any woman buy jewelry for herself?

22
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:54,050
Isn’t jewelry given by men to women?

23
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,250
Uncle, what do you say?

24
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:58,810
All our family's money is on my wife's card

25
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,330
It’s not just husbands from poor families

26
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:02,600
Will you give the money to your wife?

27
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,390
If she’s not a tough mother, why is she so lucky?
